From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Thu Mar  2 22:46:21 2017
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 02 Mar 2017 22:46:21 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Why upper limit on parameters changes the behaviour of the sampler?
