Hi Daniel,

Sorry for the lack of info provided. I was hoping there was something obviously wrong in the model. The rhats are all over the place. The max rhat is 812.51, and the model runs very fast. I am thinking there is something in modeling the Covar of within/across group-random effects where things go awry, but I am not sure. Any help is greatly appreciated, I have been relying on this forum multiple times, and the work you guys are doing is unbelievable.

Many thanks,
Tobi

