I was actually able to solve this for the special case I was considering (details in this thread: https://groups.google.com/forum/#!category-topic/stan-users/MAKPeWvqbFs ), which for this thread boils down to doing:

data {
  vector[N] Y ;
  matrix[N,K] X ;
}
transformed data {
  vector[N] obs ;
  obs = inverse(transpose(X) * X) * transpose(X) * Y ;
}

