Subject: Re: [stan-users] Left-hand side of sampling statement (~) may contain a non-linear transform of a parameter or local
Message-ID: <F1piPpqn7sc.G6EGffF2DgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <F1piPpqn7sc.0jLjShdoDgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <F1piPpqn7sc.0jLjShdoDgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
