On Monday, March 13, 2017 at 11:01:59 AM UTC-4, John Palmer wrote:
> How can I specify the re.form equation given as an argument to posterior_predict{rstanarm} (or to predict.merMod{lme4}) in a two level-model for which I want to condition on one level but not the other? Thanks.

That is supposed to work the same way in posterior_predict() as it does in predict.merMod(). I believe you just do something like

~ (1 + x | g)

where g is the grouping variable you want to condition on and you omit the grouping variable that you want to integrate over.

Ben

