> >
> > Is it the standard Squared Exponential (SE) kernel shown below?
> >
> >  <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-u-QAQ7j-zu8/WM33nFT1zJI/AAAAAAAAVcU/fWeeWXNOsx0jw4454bEj76d_6qo20q10wCLcB/s1600/se.png>
