On Friday, March 24, 2017 at 11:23:29 AM UTC-4, Ru Wang wrote:
> 2. I got 8 totally same sample chains.

If so, then none of the chains moved and you have bigger problems. Unless you run out of RAM, it is not going to be slower to do chains in parallel on different physical processors than to run them serially on one processor.

Ben

